 two lower cranks a single swinging bail. It clears the back of the posts. Upper 18 mm carrier is a separate nonrotating structure.","assembly":"Bond saddle crowns to PETG and saddle bores to carrier in fixture. Slide cheek spigots into carrier and fit radial endcap screws. Index and weld both square crank sockets with axes aligned. Fit bushed pivots and shim stacks. Fixed end bridges are welded to the forward faces of the posts.","light":"Static upward COB channel on the bridges beneath the returned rear PC land. Contoured isolators retain the diffuser independently. Base side entry and post chase provided for SELV supply; harness, connector and external driver not modeled."}}